---
description: Documentation lookup policy for inference-sandbox
alwaysApply: true
---

When modifying code or docs involving PyTorch, vLLM, TensorRT-LLM, Dynamo, CUDA, NeMo, or Hugging Face APIs:

- Prefer the project’s indexed Cursor Docs when available:
  - PyTorch: @pytorch-stable
  - vLLM: @vllm-stable
  - TensorRT-LLM: @tensorrt-llm
  - Dynamo: @nvidia-dynamo
- Do not invent API names from memory.
- Before using a Python symbol, verify it in the active `nvidia` environment with:
  `python -c "from <module> import <symbol>; help(<symbol>)"`
- If docs and installed package disagree, trust the installed package and note the version mismatch.
- For benchmark code, report p50/p95/p99, not only means.